      &#9672; Social Media
      <a href="/admin/social" class="guide-toggle" style="text-decoration:none;">Open Portal &rarr;</a>
    </h2>
    <p class="desc">
      The one place to connect your accounts for publishing &amp; scheduling from the <a href="/admin/social">Social portal</a>. Secrets are encrypted (AES-256-GCM) at rest — you'll only ever see a masked hint after saving.
